{"data":{"repository":{"discussion":{"title":"providers depencies failled at 1st shell opening","body":"I have the following setup :\r\n\r\n- my 1password sa token is stored in password-store (~/password-store}\r\n- other secrets are fetched from 1 password\r\n\r\nWhen i spawn a new sheel i get the following : \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1414\" height=\"148\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2026-09-09 at 4 31 27 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/548266f7-79d4-480b-9821-ab81ba569e54\" />\r\n\r\nMy config is as follows:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# fnox.toml\r\n[providers.pass]\r\ntype = \"password-store\"\r\n\r\n[providers.1password]\r\ntype = \"1password\"\r\nvault = \"perso\"\r\n\r\n[secrets]\r\nOP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN = { provider = \"pass-local\", value = \"fnox/OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN\" }\r\nPROXMOX_URL    = { provider = \"1password\", value = \"proxmox/url\" }\r\nPROXMOX_TOKEN  = { provider = \"1password\", value = \"proxmox/username\" }\r\nPROXMOX_SECRET = { provider = \"1password\", value = \"proxmox/password\"}\r\n```\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# fnox.local.toml\r\ndefault_provider = \"pass-local\"\r\n\r\n[providers.pass-local]\r\ntype = \"password-store\"\r\nstore_dir = \"/Users/frederic/.password-store\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nMy question is why one gets loaded in env correctly and not the 1password ones ?\r\n\r\n<img width=\"994\" height=\"170\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2026-09-09 at 4 37 40 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b78eebbb-5f8f-48ed-ba0e-19de28d05c94\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"644\" height=\"926\" alt=\"Screen Shot 2026-09-09 at 4 39 35 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d5cea66-4c8a-4fc9-9868-7fcfaf59038a\" />\r\n\r\n","url":"https://github.com/jdx/fnox/discussions/837","comments":{"nodes":[]}}}}}rg: tests: No such file or directory (os error 2)
