   721	/// Secrets are resolved in dependency order using Kahn's algorithm. If a provider
   722	/// declares env var dependencies (e.g., 1Password needs `OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN`),
   723	/// and another secret provides that env var (e.g., an age-encrypted secret named
   724	/// `OP_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_TOKEN`), the dependency is resolved first. Between resolution
   725	/// levels, resolved values are set as environment variables so subsequent providers
   726	/// can read them.
